# Console screenshots are regenerable build output: scripts/capture_console.py
# rebuilds them from a running stack and records provenance in
# capture-manifest.json. A full desktop+narrow set is ~70 MB, so the images stay
# out of the tree; run `make console-capture` to produce them.
